<view class="wrap">
  <view class="card card-accent">
    <image class="identity-brand-logo" src="/assets/brand-logo.jpg" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="会规智云品牌标识"/>
    <view class="page-kicker" style="text-align:center">会规智云</view>
    <view class="heading" style="text-align:center">手机号快捷登录</view>
    <view class="subtitle" style="text-align:center">验证手机号后进入会规智云，后续可通过已绑定账号快捷登录。</view>

    <view class="notice">
      <text class="notice-icon">i</text>
      <text>本系统将验证手机号并匹配已有账号权限；未匹配到已有账号的手机号将创建普通用户账号。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="consent-box">
      <checkbox-group bindchange="agree">
        <label class="consent-label">
          <checkbox value="agree" checked="{{consent}}" color="#2e5fa3"/>
          <text>我同意使用手机号进行身份识别、账号绑定与权限匹配。手机号不会在业务页面公开展示。</text>
        </label>
      </checkbox-group>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error"><text class="feedback-icon">!</text><text>{{error}}</text></view>
    <button class="btn primary" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="getPhoneNumber" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||!consent}}">
      手机号快捷登录
    </button>
    <view class="privacy-note">手机号仅用于会规智云账号识别、登录及权限匹配。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card entry-card" bindtap="publicApply">
    <view class="entry-icon public">公众</view>
    <view class="grow">
      <view class="entry-title">无需登录，直接申请活动</view>
      <view class="entry-sub">社会公众活动意向申请无需登录</view>
    </view>
    <view class="chevron">›</view>
  </view>
</view>
